   ["fact","What is stated about the changes?",["Hallway lights will turn off automatically when no one is there.","Guests will be asked to adjust their own thermostats.","They are expected to cut electricity costs by half.","They will begin this week."],"'switch off automatically when no one is present'와 일치한다. 절감 예상치는 약 15%이고 시행은 다음 달이다. no one is present가 no one is there로 바꿔 쓰인 점에 주목하자."],
   ["blank",BLANK_Q,["rooms will return to a normal temperature as soon as guests check in","room rates will increase slightly to cover the cost of the sensors","guests will be asked to switch off hallway lights themselves","hallways will be closed to guests after ten o'clock at night"],"온도 조절은 빈 객실에만 적용되므로, 손님이 체크인하면 정상 온도로 돌아간다는 내용이 '편안함의 차이를 못 느낀다'의 이유로 맞다."]
